<view class="page"><view class="title">订单记录</view><view class="subtitle">支付中断时请先查询订单，不要重复付款。</view><view class="row"><button class="button secondary" data-channel="WECHAT_VIRTUAL" bindtap="channel">微信虚拟支付</button><button class="button secondary" data-channel="ALIPAY" bindtap="channel">支付宝记录</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!busy &amp;&amp; !items.length}}" class="card">暂无订单记录</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="card-title">{{item.subject}}</view><view class="row">¥{{item.price}} · {{item.statusText}}</view><view class="note" selectable>{{item.outTradeNo}}</view><view class="small muted">创建：{{item.createdText}}<br/>支付确认：{{item.paidText}}<br/>通知 / 发货：{{item.feedbackText}}<br/>最近查单：{{item.queryText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.failureReason}}" class="error">{{item.failureReason}}</view><button class="button secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="query">查询最新支付状态</button><button wx:if="{{item.status==='PENDING' &amp;&amp; channel==='WECHAT_VIRTUAL'}}" class="button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="resume">查看 / 继续支付</button></view><view class="row"><button class="button secondary" disabled="{{page&lt;=1||busy}}" bindtap="prev">上一页</button><text>第 {{page}} 页 · {{total}} 条</text><button class="button secondary" disabled="{{page*20&gt;=total||busy}}" bindtap="next">下一页</button></view></view>
